                                                                        
  I PHYSICAL PARAMETERS                                                 
     1) External radiation:                                             
        Spectrum =  1  
        Number of BB =  1
        Temperature = 2600 K
        
     2) Dust Properties 
     
       2.1 Chemical composition                       
           optical properties index = 1
           Abundances for supported grain types:
               Sil-Ow  Sil-Oc  Sil-DL  grf-DL  amC-Hn  SiC-Pg 
           x =  0.00    0.00    1.00    0.00    0.00    0.00
       
          2.2 Grain size distribution

          Size distribution = 2
          q = 3.5, a(min) = 0.005 micron, a(max) = 0.25 micron 
                                                                        
       2.3 Dust temperature on inner boundary:

        - temperature = 100 K
                         

     3) Density Distribution
        - density type = 4;	Y = 1.0e4                  
        %- number of powers = 1                
        %- shell's relative thickness = 1000   
        %- power = 2        
        
        
        
     4) Optical Depth     
        - grid type = 1                    % linear grid
        - lambda0 = 2.2 micron            % optical depth specified 
  - tau(min) = 0.25; tau(max) = 1.3 % for the visual wavelength
        - number of models = 1            
